OL,3,GNEWSABrookside star who went on run
OL,4,Ajailed for #13m modelling fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former TV soap actor who went on the
OL,7,Frun before his trial for a #13.6m
OL,8,Fmodelling fraud has been jailed for
OL,9,Fnine years.
OL,11,FPhilip Foster, 51, who played Christian
OL,12,FWright in the Liverpool soap Brookside,
OL,13,Fwas jailed in his absence for eight and
OL,14,Fa half years in February 2025 for fraud
OL,15,Fand money laundering, after conning
OL,16,Fthousands of would-be models.
OL,18,FHe hid in Spain but was arrested in
OL,19,FAlicante in September and subsequently
OL,20,Fextradited to the UK. He was given an
OL,21,Fextra six-month sentence for
OL,22,Fabsconding.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
