OL,3,GNEWSABrookside star who went on run
OL,4,Ajailed for #13m modelling fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Sheffield Crown Court, Judge David
OL,7,FDixon told him: "You were a coward, you
OL,8,Fdecided to hide and didn't come and
OL,9,Fface the music."
